# Build context is the repo root; keep it small and free of secrets.
.git
.github
.claude
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
server/tests
docs
# The Rust agent isn't part of any image; its target/ folder alone is gigabytes.
agent
# The server image never needs nginx's files, and nginx/certs holds a root-only
# private key once nginx has made its certificate: unreadable for the build.
nginx
